# BE-LOOP-001 implementation-path allowlist (machine-readable; source of truth for the
# impl-binds generator). Paths are RELATIVE TO /source (= dev-0 root). A line "allow P"
# permits approved writes under prefix P; "deny P" forbids them even if an allow matches.
# The generator REJECTS: absolute host paths, ".." traversal, anything not under /source,
# any approved path outside these prefixes, and any path shadowing a read-only/overlay mount.
# This closes defect 2: impl mounts come ONLY from an approved+allowlist-validated record.

server
